        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Knight Brawler</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by the masterpieces of the past, Knight Brawler is a nostalgic 2D platformer that combines thrilling action with vintage game play. In order to save the girl and vanquish the evil that stands in your way, you must bravely navigate a number of difficult levels that are full with fierce foes, fearsome platforming scenes, and a formidable boss.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Inspired by Retro Legends</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every level pays special tribute to the heyday of video games. You'll encounter a wide variety of obstacles that will put your abilities and reflexes to the test, whether you're fighting your way through platforming parts or slashing in intense action.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Epic Adventure Awaits</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate through a variety of lively settings while you slash and jump your way through every level. Before you battle the ultimate villain in the final showdown, you must defeat a unique collection of foes and challenges in each stage.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classic 2D Platforming: Slash, jump, and fight your way through dangerous, retro-inspired levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nostalgic Sound &amp; Visuals: With pixel art, nostalgic music, and an exhilarating arcade setting, relive the enchantment of classic games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save the Girl: In this timeless story of bravery, save the girl and vanquish the evil forces that are endangering the land.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare to fight your way in Knight Brawler, the ultimate homage to classic video games!</p>",
